 puts the person straight after 幫忙 (我幫忙他). Textbook Mandarin treats 幫忙 as verb + object and says 我幫他 or 我幫他的忙.","category":"grammar","type":"grammar","example_zh":"我幫忙他搬家。","example_zhuyin":"ㄨㄛˇ ㄅㄤ ㄇㄤˊ ㄊㄚ ㄅㄢ ㄐㄧㄚ","example_spoken":"ㄨㄛˇ ㄅㄤ ㄇㄤˊ ㄊㄚ ㄅㄢ ㄐㄧㄚ","example_audio":"audio/tts/tts_f6999344d392.mp3","example_en":"I helped him move house."},{"taiwan":"啦","taiwan_zhuyin":"˙ㄌㄚ","spoken":"˙ㄌㄚ","p":"la","mainland":"","en":"Sentence-final particle that makes a statement casual: reassuring, settling or a little impatient.","category":"particles","type":"grammar","id":"1748","s":[0.0,0.395],"example_zh":"好啦，我知道啦。","example_zhuyin":"ㄏㄠˇ ˙ㄌㄚ ㄨㄛˇ ㄓ ㄉㄠˋ ˙ㄌㄚ","example_spoken":"ㄏㄠˇ ˙ㄌㄚ ㄨㄛˇ ㄓ ㄉㄠˋ ˙ㄌㄚ","example_audio":"audio/tts/tts_45f1db588d45.mp3","example_en":"OK, OK, I know."},{"taiwan":"齁","taiwan_zhuyin":"ㄏㄡ","spoken":"ㄏㄡ","p":"hōu","mainland":"","en":"Spoken particle that asks for agreement, like \"…, right?\" or \"isn't it?\" (Zhuyin as the MOE dictionary lists it).","category":"particles","type":"grammar","id":null,"s":null,"example_zh":"今天很熱齁？","example_zhuyin":"ㄐㄧㄣ ㄊㄧㄢ ㄏㄣˇ ㄖㄜˋ ㄏㄡ","example_spoken":"ㄐㄧㄣ ㄊㄧㄢ ㄏㄣˇ ㄖㄜˋ ㄏㄡ","example_audio":"audio/tts/tts_76fce8d74b7a.mp3","example_en":"It's really hot today, isn't it?"},{"taiwan":"喔","taiwan_zhuyin":"ㄛ","spoken":"ㄛ","p":"ō","mainland":"","en":"Sentence-final particle for a friendly reminder or warning, or to show you've understood: \"mind you\", \"OK?\", \"oh, I see\".","category":"particles","type":"grammar","id":"5714","s":[0.0,0.324],"example_zh":"騎車小心喔！","example_zhuyin":"ㄑㄧˊ ㄔㄜ ㄒㄧㄠˇ ㄒㄧㄣ ㄛ","example_spoken":"ㄑㄧˊ ㄔㄜ ㄒㄧㄠˇ ㄒㄧㄣ ㄛ","example_audio":"audio/tts/tts_4cf111f1560c.mp3","example_en":"Ride carefully, OK?"},{"taiwan":"欸","taiwan_zhuyin":"ㄟˋ","spoken":"ㄟˋ","p":"èi","mainland":"","en":"At the start of a sentence: gets someone's attention (\"hey\") or shows you've just noticed something.","category":"particles","type":"grammar","id":"5769","s":[0.0,0.491],"example_zh":"欸，你的手機掉了。","example_zhuyin":"ㄟˋ ㄋㄧˇ ˙ㄉㄜ ㄕㄡˇ ㄐㄧ ㄉㄧㄠˋ ˙ㄌㄜ","example_spoken":"ㄟˋ ㄋㄧˇ ˙ㄉㄜ ㄕㄡˇ ㄐㄧ ㄉㄧㄠˋ ˙ㄌㄜ","example_audio":"audio/tts/tts_59ba5e69e86e.mp3","example_en":"Hey, you dropped your phone."},{"taiwan":"不錯吃","taiwan_zhuyin":"ㄅㄨˋ ㄘㄨㄛˋ ㄔ","spoken":"ㄅㄨˊ ㄘㄨㄛˋ ㄔ","p":"bùcuòchī","mainland":"好吃／挺好吃","en":"\"Pretty tasty\": Taiwan speech puts 不錯 \"not bad\" straight before 吃, the way 好吃 is built from 好.","category":"grammar","type":"grammar","id":null,"s":null,"example_zh":"這家的牛肉麵不錯吃。","example_zhuyin":"ㄓㄜˋ ㄐㄧㄚ ˙ㄉㄜ ㄋㄧㄡˊ ㄖㄡˋ ㄇㄧㄢˋ ㄅㄨˋ ㄘㄨㄛˋ ㄔ","example_spoken":"ㄓㄜˋ ㄐㄧㄚ ˙ㄉㄜ ㄋㄧㄡˊ ㄖㄡˋ ㄇㄧㄢˋ ㄅㄨˊ ㄘㄨㄛˋ ㄔ","example_audio":"audio/tts/tts_1c4d02e44792.mp3","example_en":"The beef noodles at this place are pretty tasty."}]